    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just want some peace. like, actual peace. not just \"feeling better\" for an hour before it all comes crashing back down. i look at the door and i just think about how much easier it would be if i just wasn't here to feel this. if i just disappeared, at least the struggle would finally be over.",
